  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "He arrives among Eastern Sea immortal zombie reinforcements that Blazing Heaven Demoness leads back to Dark Flow Giant City. He has a bad temper and is ruthless. While passing the regional wall he attacked allies who disagreed with him. Among four rank seven immortal zombies who died, three died to him. Their corpses were blown to bits and the explosion let him advance. After viewing the ransacked immortal zombie graveyard he still looks grim at traces of Old Ancestor Xue Hu. He tells Northern Plains Zombie Alliance not to investigate a hidden immortal zombie, naming the person a Zombie Alliance member they have come to rescue, and refuses to explain the secret mission. He proposes approaching the captive Blazing Glory Lightning Brilliance immortal zombie directly rather than wasting time, since that zombie’s body holds abundant fire path and lightning path dao marks and suits the refining of Gu. Blazing Heaven Demoness calls that a boor’s act; he then proposes sneaking into Snowy Mountain blessed land instead, and she dares him to try it alone. He is left ashamed and angry. He also flatters her as a valuable Zombie Alliance member toward becoming overlord of the five regions.",
      "chapters": [
        929
      ],
